WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 14]

01:35.399 --> 01:37.839
The testimonies they gave before
were all fake.

01:37.920 --> 01:39.780
They might recant them

01:39.800 --> 01:41.800
if they were sent
to the Ministry of Justice.

01:42.159 --> 01:44.939
Hence, Li Chengze
decided to silence them.

01:44.959 --> 01:46.739
Everything

01:46.759 --> 01:48.639
adds up by now.

01:53.480 --> 01:54.620
Exactly.

01:54.640 --> 01:57.960
Fortunately, the truth is revealed.

01:59.720 --> 02:03.520
Fan Wujiu is a brilliant pawn
that can be used against his owner.

02:05.720 --> 02:08.000
But there is something I don't get.

02:08.600 --> 02:10.759
Why would he show up there?

02:12.239 --> 02:13.659
I don't get it either.

02:13.679 --> 02:14.979
I swear to Heaven,

02:14.999 --> 02:17.259
Fan Wujiu has already left the Capital
for another mission.

02:17.279 --> 02:18.600
Besides, you knew

02:18.620 --> 02:20.780
that I suggested the Ministry of Justice
take the culprits away.

02:20.800 --> 02:22.359
If I were the culprit,

02:22.519 --> 02:24.560
isn't that extra work?

02:26.920 --> 02:28.359
I'm confused.

02:28.679 --> 02:30.120
To be honest,

02:31.279 --> 02:32.880
I'm confused too.

02:36.839 --> 02:37.919
Wait.

02:38.360 --> 02:39.759
Is Fan Wujiu dead?

02:39.920 --> 02:41.000
No.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.800
They captured him alive.

02:43.040 --> 02:44.379
Everything will be all right, then.

02:44.399 --> 02:45.699
So as long Fan Wujiu admits

02:45.719 --> 02:47.180
that you sent him out of the Capital,

02:47.200 --> 02:49.000
your suspicion could be cleared.

03:01.360 --> 03:03.039
But he can't admit that.

03:03.920 --> 03:05.800
The public mustn't know
that Second Prince sent him

03:05.800 --> 03:08.479
to assassinate Fan Sizhe.

03:09.399 --> 03:10.580
Besides,

03:10.600 --> 03:12.340
Fan Sizhe was traveling

03:12.360 --> 03:14.560
with the members
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

03:15.320 --> 03:18.259
Killing the authority equals treason.

03:18.279 --> 03:19.580
If I were Fan Wujiu,

03:19.600 --> 03:21.759
I had better keep my mouth shut.

03:21.839 --> 03:23.140
After all,

03:23.160 --> 03:25.919
killing a murderer is better
than treason.

03:26.920 --> 03:29.479
Did you send Fan Sizhe away?

03:29.800 --> 03:30.880
Yes.

03:32.600 --> 03:34.880
Did you plan this

03:35.760 --> 03:38.280
when you sent him away?

03:39.760 --> 03:41.079
No.

03:41.519 --> 03:43.320
I couldn't have seen this coming.

03:43.480 --> 03:45.359
I was thinking

03:45.405 --> 03:48.259
that the Second Prince
wouldn't let him pass easily

03:48.279 --> 03:50.479
since he was involved
in the Baoyue Pleasure House.

03:51.439 --> 03:53.000
I just considered more

03:53.245 --> 03:54.645
for his safety.

03:55.399 --> 03:57.799
Judging by Fan Wujiu's skills,

03:57.999 --> 03:59.759
ordinary ninth-ranked guards

04:00.279 --> 04:02.419
couldn't hold him down.

04:02.439 --> 04:04.120
Indeed.

04:04.679 --> 04:06.680
Who could capture him, then?

04:08.040 --> 04:10.639
Needless to say,
it must be someone exceptional.

04:32.639 --> 04:33.500
What is this place?

04:33.520 --> 04:35.040
You had killed lives

04:35.360 --> 04:37.386
in the Capital Magistrate's presence.

04:37.406 --> 04:39.046
Is it fun playing dumb here?

04:42.879 --> 04:44.279
Kill lives?

04:45.360 --> 04:46.419
Why?

04:46.439 --> 04:49.000
Are you trying
to deny the solid evidence?

05:23.970 --> 05:25.940
[Haitang Duoduo,
Northern Qi Holy Maiden]

05:28.160 --> 05:29.560
What a surprise.

05:29.800 --> 05:31.680
To think that Northern Qi Hold Maiden

05:32.239 --> 05:34.519
is protecting a Qing man.

05:34.840 --> 05:36.599
A Qing is killing another Qing.

05:36.679 --> 05:38.279
The Qi might as well play along.

05:38.639 --> 05:40.279
Play along, you say?

05:42.520 --> 05:44.040
You would like to play along.

05:45.920 --> 05:48.240
Having a duel
with the Northern Qi Holy Maiden

05:49.720 --> 05:51.519
makes my years of practice

05:51.800 --> 05:53.599
worthwhile!

06:44.360 --> 06:45.560
For real?

06:45.679 --> 06:47.360
You may kill, but never insult me!

07:03.600 --> 07:05.000
The defeat was well-earned.

07:07.280 --> 07:09.140
This is just a normal cooperation.

07:09.160 --> 07:10.700
Haitang Duoduo and I

07:10.720 --> 07:12.539
are not related in any way.

07:12.559 --> 07:14.059
I haven't said anything yet.

07:14.079 --> 07:15.480
I know what you are thinking.

07:15.480 --> 07:17.460
I have the responsibility to say
that you got the wrong idea.

07:17.460 --> 07:18.539
Continue if you wish.

07:18.559 --> 07:20.159
I will even swear to Heaven!

07:21.759 --> 07:23.480
Who am I to Wan'er?

07:24.119 --> 07:24.820
You are her father.

07:24.840 --> 07:26.839
If so, do you think
I should believe you?

07:27.720 --> 07:30.120
You shouldn't doubt my character.

07:32.520 --> 07:34.280
Didn't you entrust the Lin family
and Wan'er to me

07:34.280 --> 07:35.960
because you believe I'm honest?

07:35.960 --> 07:37.140
This is the Capital.

07:37.160 --> 07:38.340
Do I dare to trust

07:38.360 --> 07:39.659
someone honest?

07:39.679 --> 07:40.920
But I'm clear and innocent.

07:40.920 --> 07:42.119
Are you not going to trust me, then?

07:42.119 --> 07:43.400
Your shamelessness

07:43.400 --> 07:46.480
is the hope of our Lin family
in the future.

07:46.720 --> 07:47.639
Is that

07:47.639 --> 07:49.500
a compliment or an insult?

07:49.520 --> 07:50.900
A compliment, of course.

07:50.920 --> 07:54.099
It was a masterstroke
to tackle Fan Wujiu.

07:54.119 --> 07:56.780
The death warriors, slander, culprit,

07:56.800 --> 07:57.920
and all the schemes

07:57.920 --> 08:00.279
have been overturned by now.

08:00.360 --> 08:01.759
In this round,

08:01.840 --> 08:04.839
Li Chengze is showing signs of defeat.

08:48.240 --> 08:49.359
You are here.

09:03.839 --> 09:05.119
We don't have much time.

09:05.359 --> 09:06.090
So make it quick.

09:06.110 --> 09:07.440
Tell me what happened.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.840
I was trying to kill Fan Sizhe

09:13.319 --> 09:15.079
inside Northern Qi.

09:16.280 --> 09:18.280
Haitang Duoduo stepped in

09:19.760 --> 09:20.920
and I lost.

09:21.920 --> 09:25.760
They escorted me back to the Capital
and detained me for a few days.

09:26.079 --> 09:27.839
I was knocked out this morning.

09:28.959 --> 09:30.250
When I woke up,

09:30.270 --> 09:32.260
I found myself
in front of the Capital Magistrate.

09:32.280 --> 09:33.819
Haitang Duoduo escorted you back here?

09:33.839 --> 09:35.119
It wasn't her.

09:35.920 --> 09:39.040
It was the Imperial Inspectorate.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.400
Imperial Inspectorate?

09:45.400 --> 09:47.760
Do you know what the situation is now?

09:47.959 --> 09:49.079
I'm not sure.

09:49.800 --> 09:51.160
But don't worry.

09:51.439 --> 09:52.680
My lips are sealed.

09:53.319 --> 09:55.119
I won't reveal anything.

10:01.959 --> 10:03.760
His Highness prepared those murderers

10:04.319 --> 10:06.199
to use against Fan Xian.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.800
But then, your appearance

10:11.800 --> 10:14.520
has driven His Highness to a dead end.

10:17.479 --> 10:18.339
Will I be killed?

10:18.359 --> 10:19.860
You can't die just yet.

10:19.880 --> 10:21.059
What should I do next?

10:21.079 --> 10:22.159
First,

10:22.800 --> 10:24.540
don't bring up

10:24.560 --> 10:26.130
the assassination of Fan Sizhe.

10:27.079 --> 10:27.699
Understood.

10:27.719 --> 10:28.799
Second,

10:29.000 --> 10:32.640
find another reason for the assassination
in front of the Capital Magistrate.

10:33.000 --> 10:34.680
Don't get His Highness involved.

10:34.760 --> 10:36.359
With my current identity,

10:36.959 --> 10:38.800
they won't believe everything I say.

10:38.820 --> 10:40.890
It doesn't matter
whether they believe it or not.

10:41.079 --> 10:42.780
Only a workable reason is needed.

10:42.800 --> 10:43.880
Sure.

10:44.520 --> 10:45.600
All right.

10:46.439 --> 10:47.519
I will do it.

10:54.439 --> 10:55.719
Not much time is left.

10:57.040 --> 10:58.880
Is there anything else you want to say?

10:58.920 --> 11:00.550
I will relay it to His Highness.

11:12.520 --> 11:13.640
Xie,

11:15.040 --> 11:16.999
did I lose my chance

11:18.839 --> 11:20.560
to sit for the spring exam?

11:32.160 --> 11:33.999
Thank His Highness on my behalf.

11:37.319 --> 11:39.440
At least he gave me hope.

11:44.959 --> 11:46.359
Tell him that I'm thankful.

11:53.439 --> 11:54.599
I should get going.

11:55.120 --> 11:56.200
Xie.

11:58.240 --> 11:59.479
Please do me a favor.

11:59.920 --> 12:00.980
Go on.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.400
Bring me a book.

12:04.760 --> 12:05.920
Just one.

12:07.439 --> 12:08.719
I want classics.

12:10.679 --> 12:11.959
Any book will do.

12:17.400 --> 12:18.599
Thank you.

12:24.599 --> 12:25.760
Thank you.

12:36.640 --> 12:38.440
His Highness predicted that.

12:48.600 --> 12:50.320
[Book of Documents]

12:52.719 --> 12:54.479
He knows me the best.

13:24.560 --> 13:26.440
Tell His Highness
that I'm grateful to him.

14:04.043 --> 14:05.440
How did they treat you?

14:06.760 --> 14:08.079
Do you have meat?

15:05.520 --> 15:06.740
Haitang Duoduo

15:06.760 --> 15:08.980
and the Imperial Inspectorate
are on Fan Xian's side.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.400
Is something going on

15:10.400 --> 15:12.179
between Haitang Duoduo and Fan Xian?

15:12.199 --> 15:13.500
I don't think so.

15:13.520 --> 15:14.900
Then, why did she help him?

15:14.920 --> 15:16.320
Because Fan Xian

15:16.559 --> 15:18.920
is the future owner
of the Imperial Treasury.

15:24.100 --> 15:25.760
[Shangjing City, capital of Northern Qi]
Holy Maiden,

15:25.760 --> 15:28.120
thank you for rescuing me
in desperate times like that.

15:30.240 --> 15:31.359
Is it all right?

15:32.679 --> 15:33.759
Yes.

15:33.839 --> 15:34.919
All right.

15:36.320 --> 15:37.920
Wait. What are you talking about?

15:38.959 --> 15:40.560
The Shangjing City.

15:41.760 --> 15:43.239
Yes, of course.

15:44.040 --> 15:46.310
How does it compare to the Capital
of the Qing State?

15:48.079 --> 15:49.720
They are unique in their own way.

15:50.839 --> 15:52.659
Why are you covering your face?

15:52.679 --> 15:54.119
Don't do that.

15:54.319 --> 15:56.239
I'm afraid people might recognize me.

15:57.839 --> 15:59.160
People in both states

15:59.160 --> 16:00.640
look almost the same.

16:00.660 --> 16:02.710
Don't worry. They can't tell the difference
by looking at faces.

16:02.719 --> 16:03.380
Put it down.

16:03.400 --> 16:04.480
It's not that.

16:04.959 --> 16:07.560
Do you know
how famous I am in the Qing State?

16:08.640 --> 16:10.140
My father is Fan Jian.

16:10.160 --> 16:11.459
The Minister of Revenue.

16:11.479 --> 16:12.980
Earl Sinan.

16:13.000 --> 16:14.240
Imagine how dangerous I can be

16:14.250 --> 16:16.239
as the child of a dignitary
in a foreign land.

16:16.280 --> 16:18.560
I'm starting to admire
the Fan family now.

16:19.679 --> 16:20.539
Thank you,

16:20.559 --> 16:21.639
Sister-in-law.

16:23.439 --> 16:24.519
Hold on.

16:26.270 --> 16:27.719
What did you just call me?

16:30.079 --> 16:31.239
Ha! You like that.

16:32.040 --> 16:34.040
But I can only call you that here.

16:34.760 --> 16:35.840
Sister-in-law.

16:41.000 --> 16:42.670
What did Fan Xian tell you about me?

16:44.079 --> 16:45.599
He needn't tell me anything.

16:45.800 --> 16:47.780
The entire Qing State knows.

16:47.800 --> 16:49.280
I understand.

16:49.959 --> 16:51.560
You understand, my foot.

16:51.640 --> 16:52.459
Listen,

16:52.479 --> 16:53.319
this is the Qi.

16:53.319 --> 16:54.590
Don't talk nonsense.
Stop calling me that.

16:54.599 --> 16:56.179
We have to keep it on the down-low here?

16:56.199 --> 16:57.160
No!

16:57.160 --> 16:58.560
Gone public already?

16:59.040 --> 17:01.959
I have nothing to do with Fan Xian.

17:03.120 --> 17:04.839
Nothing. Absolutely nothing.

17:05.040 --> 17:07.379
Well, Sister-in-law,
you need not hide it from me.

17:07.399 --> 17:09.240
I'm on your side.
You have my support.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.780
What nonsense are you saying?

17:10.800 --> 17:12.520
You haven't seen another sister-in-law
back in the Capital.

17:12.520 --> 17:14.420
She is so weak

17:14.440 --> 17:15.159
and lacks energy.

17:15.159 --> 17:16.500
She is like Daiyu from "Red Mansion."

17:16.520 --> 17:18.020
Unlike you,

17:18.040 --> 17:19.520
you are well-built...

17:21.040 --> 17:22.220
I'm telling you.

17:22.240 --> 17:23.020
I helped Fan Xian

17:23.040 --> 17:25.520
mainly because he would take over
the Imperial Treasury.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.319
The two states

17:27.319 --> 17:28.800
have some business.

17:28.800 --> 17:30.020
Do you understand?

17:30.040 --> 17:31.120
If

17:31.599 --> 17:33.299
a civil strife breaks up
in the Qing State,

17:33.319 --> 17:35.520
I will be happy to see that. Understood?

17:38.299 --> 17:39.339
So

17:39.359 --> 17:41.200
you just won't believe me?

17:49.040 --> 17:49.650
Come on.

17:49.670 --> 17:51.350
Where are we going, Sister-in-law?

17:52.550 --> 17:56.559
[Oil Store]

17:56.559 --> 17:57.639
Here we are.

17:57.680 --> 17:58.760
Go inside.

17:59.040 --> 18:01.359
This is Qing's store
in the Shangjing City.

18:01.559 --> 18:03.399
What is this for?

18:04.919 --> 18:07.139
Command center of spies.

18:07.159 --> 18:08.960
Fan Xian wanted me to bring you here.

18:12.800 --> 18:14.020
Command center of spies?

18:14.040 --> 18:15.120
Exactly.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.680
He even told you a place like this?

18:17.680 --> 18:19.119
I know you both are...

18:20.520 --> 18:22.359
Good friends.

18:24.319 --> 18:25.639
I have done my bit here.

18:26.079 --> 18:27.480
You are on your own now.

18:37.808 --> 18:40.354
[Cold Medicine]

18:53.119 --> 18:54.280
Is anyone here?

18:54.520 --> 18:55.899
I caught a cold.

18:55.919 --> 18:57.420
I'm not serving today.

18:57.440 --> 18:59.280
Please help yourself.

19:07.599 --> 19:08.410
Guo Baokun.

19:08.430 --> 19:10.400
[Guo Baokun, spy stationed in the Qi]
Fan Sizhe?

19:12.399 --> 19:13.479
You...

19:23.520 --> 19:24.379
Wait.

19:24.399 --> 19:25.839
That's medicine.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.680
Where is Fan Xian?

19:28.440 --> 19:29.960
At home, maybe. I don't know.

19:30.040 --> 19:32.079
What are you doing here instead?

19:32.159 --> 19:33.420
I'm here to offer help.

19:33.440 --> 19:35.159
You can't be serious.

19:35.359 --> 19:37.439
Do you know what this place is?

19:38.839 --> 19:40.679
All undercover spies of the Qing State

19:40.879 --> 19:44.399
are under my command.

19:44.680 --> 19:47.520
Don't interfere
with an important task like this.

19:49.159 --> 19:51.040
Why can't I come here when you are here?

19:52.440 --> 19:53.679
Jeez.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.599
Do you know Yan Bingyun?

19:56.910 --> 19:59.539
Yes. He serves in the Fourth Division
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

19:59.559 --> 20:01.220
Even a figure like him

20:01.240 --> 20:04.079
made a mistake in Northern Qi.

20:05.280 --> 20:06.679
Look at me.

20:08.006 --> 20:09.500
Under my deployment,

20:09.520 --> 20:11.780
this little store is safe,

20:11.800 --> 20:13.919
as if it hides deeply in a chasm.

20:13.919 --> 20:15.800
The disguise is simply flawless.

20:18.040 --> 20:19.539
Do you still

20:19.559 --> 20:21.520
underestimate me?

21:00.350 --> 21:02.020
You are really good
at eating, Duoduo.

21:02.040 --> 21:03.780
Yogurt and fruits are the perfect pair.

21:03.800 --> 21:04.880
Lang Tao,

21:05.440 --> 21:07.079
what brings you here?

21:07.375 --> 21:10.020
[Lang Tao, disciple of Grandmaster Ku He]
His Majesty sends me here.

21:10.119 --> 21:11.260
He wants to know

21:11.280 --> 21:12.159
if Fan Sizhe has been sent

21:12.159 --> 21:14.399
to Guo Baokun's oil store.

21:15.760 --> 21:17.619
Does His Majesty know
about the oil store too?

21:17.639 --> 21:18.740
Not only him

21:18.760 --> 21:21.220
but also all officials in the court.

21:21.240 --> 21:22.599
Even

21:22.720 --> 21:25.079
our reclusive master

21:25.079 --> 21:27.240
knows about it.

21:28.639 --> 21:30.220
His Majesty says

21:30.240 --> 21:31.819
he likes Guo Baokun.

21:31.839 --> 21:33.180
He mustn't leave.

21:33.200 --> 21:34.660
Too bad if a smart one replaces him.

21:34.680 --> 21:35.760
That's easy.

21:35.879 --> 21:37.679
Just pretend we know nothing about it.

21:40.159 --> 21:42.079
That's difficult!

21:43.119 --> 21:44.899
Pretending to overlook

21:44.919 --> 21:47.226
a careless

21:47.246 --> 21:50.246
and glaringly illogical mistake

21:51.480 --> 21:53.439
is a way too difficult thing to do.

21:59.800 --> 22:00.880
Don't worry.

22:02.040 --> 22:04.639
As long as the whole state
pulls our weight.

22:04.680 --> 22:06.800
We must keep Guo Baokun here.

22:10.960 --> 22:16.830
In my eyes, the Embroidered Uniform Guards
of Northern Qi are like weaklings.

22:17.359 --> 22:20.099
The spy network of Shangjing City
works perfectly well

22:20.119 --> 22:21.760
under my current charge.

22:22.680 --> 22:24.079
Let me put it this way.

22:24.599 --> 22:27.099
The imperial guards don't come here
when they patrol.

22:27.119 --> 22:28.320
You see,

22:29.800 --> 22:31.599
I have concealed myself so well.

22:33.159 --> 22:35.079
That sounds impressive.

22:35.480 --> 22:36.819
But it doesn't feel right.

22:36.839 --> 22:37.579
Why not?

22:37.599 --> 22:39.560
Speak up. Just say it.

22:41.800 --> 22:43.720
Everything feels right.

22:44.440 --> 22:47.599
Since Fan Xian entrusted you to me,

22:47.919 --> 22:49.420
I would do him this favor.

22:49.440 --> 22:52.079
You should learn and observe more.

22:52.320 --> 22:53.480
How about this?

22:53.599 --> 22:54.500
You will go with us

22:54.520 --> 22:55.899
for the next outing.

22:55.919 --> 22:56.780
What?

22:56.800 --> 22:57.899
Outing?

22:57.919 --> 22:58.700
With whom?

22:58.720 --> 22:59.859
The spies.

22:59.879 --> 23:01.379
Do you spies go on outings?

23:01.399 --> 23:02.579
What's wrong with that?

23:02.599 --> 23:05.020
We are far away from our hometown
in this dangerous place.

23:05.040 --> 23:06.660
Naturally, we have fear and worry.

23:06.680 --> 23:07.420
So I thought

23:07.440 --> 23:10.660
we could gather for an outing or a meal
when we have time.

23:10.680 --> 23:13.200
We can also read books together.

23:13.839 --> 23:16.579
Well... What if, I mean if.

23:16.599 --> 23:18.399
What if the Northern Qi

23:18.399 --> 23:20.139
catches you in one fell swoop

23:20.159 --> 23:22.399
while you are having a gathering?

23:23.960 --> 23:26.480
No one has ever noticed us.

23:27.359 --> 23:28.660
As you can see,

23:28.680 --> 23:31.579
I was born to be a spy.

23:31.599 --> 23:33.679
Fan Xian is so lucky to have me.

23:33.720 --> 23:34.839
Lucky him.

23:35.000 --> 23:36.700
It's a shame that you are going back.

23:36.720 --> 23:37.800
Where?

23:38.159 --> 23:39.320
Back to the Capital.

23:39.559 --> 23:41.460
Fan Xian sent me here
to take you back.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.560
Why?

23:43.240 --> 23:44.020
I don't know.

23:44.040 --> 23:46.859
He mentioned he promised you

23:46.879 --> 23:48.539
to save your father.

23:48.559 --> 23:49.410
Really?

23:49.430 --> 23:51.000
He said now is the right time.

23:52.119 --> 23:53.299
Did he give me an order?

23:53.319 --> 23:55.240
I don't know. Ask him yourself.

23:58.079 --> 23:59.480
What about this place?

23:59.879 --> 24:01.780
Are you taking over?

24:01.800 --> 24:02.940
What's wrong with me taking over?

24:02.960 --> 24:05.480
All I do is take them out
for outings and gatherings, right?

24:06.040 --> 24:07.660
But

24:07.680 --> 24:09.879
I need to send you back first.

24:10.040 --> 24:11.200
All right.

24:14.839 --> 24:15.919
What is this?

24:16.919 --> 24:18.299
What are you doing?

24:18.319 --> 24:19.679
We have a lot of time.

24:21.200 --> 24:22.619
I'm packing my things.
We can set off now.

24:22.639 --> 24:24.280
Shouldn't we do some planning?

24:24.680 --> 24:25.940
What is there to plan?

24:25.960 --> 24:27.000
We have plenty of time on the way

24:27.000 --> 24:28.059
to think about it.

24:28.079 --> 24:30.480
Never let our enemies predict our move.

24:31.040 --> 24:32.720
As long as we are quick enough,

24:32.879 --> 24:35.159
we can catch them off guard.

24:36.319 --> 24:39.000
Guo Baokun and Fan Sizhe
left the oil store

24:39.000 --> 24:40.579
and headed out of the city

24:40.599 --> 24:41.599
with a baggage?

24:41.599 --> 24:43.220
Yes, they were spotted
the moment they left.

24:43.240 --> 24:44.679
We are all watching.

24:45.399 --> 24:47.200
Are they going back to the Qing State?

24:47.599 --> 24:48.800
It seems so.

24:50.599 --> 24:51.679
What now?

24:52.040 --> 24:53.310
Should we let them go?

24:53.639 --> 24:55.000
Don't ask me.

25:00.440 --> 25:01.599
Why don't you ask

25:02.800 --> 25:04.240
His Majesty?

25:04.599 --> 25:06.099
He said he wanted to keep Guo Baokun.

25:06.119 --> 25:07.379
According to His Majesty,

25:07.399 --> 25:10.599
you decide how to deal
with Fan Sizhe and Guo Baokun.

25:16.200 --> 25:17.859
Is anyone replacing Guo Baokun?

25:17.879 --> 25:19.720
No. They left suddenly.

25:25.839 --> 25:27.560
I think we should just let them go.

25:27.919 --> 25:29.399
It's pointless keeping them.

25:29.430 --> 25:31.220
At least we can leave a good impression.

25:31.240 --> 25:33.200
Who knows?
He might come back here again.

25:33.319 --> 25:35.780
I don't care. I'm just a messenger.

25:35.800 --> 25:36.880
You decide.

25:39.520 --> 25:42.420
You all should cherish me
as the Holy Maiden.

25:42.440 --> 25:44.020
Don't make me do everything

25:44.040 --> 25:45.240
and enjoy your time idly.

25:45.240 --> 25:47.090
I'm the Holy Maiden, you know?

25:47.110 --> 25:48.970
Idly?
[*Idle and Fan Xian's name sound alike]

25:49.240 --> 25:50.020
By the way,

25:50.040 --> 25:52.619
His Majesty wants you
to write to Fan Xian.

25:52.639 --> 25:54.140
Why?

25:54.160 --> 25:56.460
It has been some time
since he returned to the Southern Qing,

25:56.480 --> 25:58.139
yet he has stopped updating
"Red Mansion".

25:58.159 --> 25:59.919
This isn't good.

26:02.480 --> 26:04.200
All you know is read books.

26:07.040 --> 26:07.780
Let them go.

26:07.800 --> 26:08.880
Yes.

26:10.079 --> 26:11.439
I will go and check on them.

26:18.280 --> 26:20.299
Why doesn't he write? Why me?

26:20.319 --> 26:21.839
Because of Fan Xian.

26:22.720 --> 26:24.040
What about him?

26:24.480 --> 26:25.859
You and him

26:25.879 --> 26:27.560
get along quite well.

26:28.520 --> 26:29.220
We...

26:29.240 --> 26:31.220
We get along well, my foot!

26:31.240 --> 26:33.000
Duoduo, you are the Holy Maiden.

26:33.000 --> 26:34.919
Do mind your language.

26:37.559 --> 26:39.059
I have nothing

26:39.079 --> 26:40.180
to do with him.

26:40.200 --> 26:41.940
It's like I have something
to do with him.

26:41.960 --> 26:43.040
You people!

26:43.200 --> 26:44.280
I...

26:44.720 --> 26:45.919
Argh!

26:47.280 --> 26:49.660
Duoduo, remember to write to him.

26:49.680 --> 26:51.280
Tell him to update.

26:54.040 --> 26:56.119
Vegetables for sale!

26:56.599 --> 26:57.460
Vegetables!

26:57.480 --> 26:58.919
Make ways.

27:16.240 --> 27:17.399
Holy Maiden.

27:18.119 --> 27:19.199
How's it?

27:19.280 --> 27:20.579
They act weirdly along the way.

27:20.599 --> 27:21.899
Many people are suspecting them.

27:21.919 --> 27:23.480
But we have already handled it.

27:23.710 --> 27:25.099
Where did they get the carriage?

27:25.119 --> 27:26.399
They rented it.

27:26.670 --> 27:27.940
Where is their destination?

27:27.960 --> 27:29.240
The border.

27:31.760 --> 27:32.879
Did they say that directly?

27:32.879 --> 27:35.099
Didn't think of switching
to another carriage halfway?

27:35.119 --> 27:35.919
Not at all.

27:35.919 --> 27:38.260
The owner of the carriage service
immediately reported to the official,

27:38.260 --> 27:39.619
but we stopped him.

27:39.639 --> 27:40.330
Holy Maiden,

27:40.350 --> 27:42.520
should we escort them
to Southern Qing safely?

27:42.800 --> 27:43.880
Yes.

27:44.879 --> 27:46.790
If so, we have to follow them
all the way.

27:49.599 --> 27:50.960
Tough days for you all.

28:00.720 --> 28:02.040
All clear.

28:04.399 --> 28:06.599
That was smart.

28:07.000 --> 28:08.780
You told him you wanted
to go to the border,

28:08.800 --> 28:10.839
not the Qing State.

28:12.599 --> 28:14.599
Laying low

28:14.800 --> 28:17.119
is the first rule of being a spy.

28:17.760 --> 28:19.280
I'm pretty gifted, right?

28:19.720 --> 28:20.839
Sizhe,

28:21.040 --> 28:22.280
looks like

28:22.639 --> 28:24.960
you have potential in this.

28:27.319 --> 28:28.399
Guo,

28:28.919 --> 28:31.919
I was rude to you before.

28:32.599 --> 28:34.299
It wasn't until today
that I realized why

28:34.319 --> 28:35.359
Fan Xian

28:35.359 --> 28:37.679
dared leave you
in the Northern Qi alone.

28:40.359 --> 28:43.359
Having talents like us,

28:43.559 --> 28:45.879
the Qing State will eventually
take over the world.

28:46.159 --> 28:48.280
Hear, hear!

28:56.599 --> 28:57.679
Mr. Fan,

28:58.280 --> 28:59.760
two news.

29:00.440 --> 29:01.460
First,

29:01.480 --> 29:02.839
Fan Wujiu

29:03.280 --> 29:05.800
has already confessed
to the Ministry of Justice.

29:06.240 --> 29:07.220
What did he say?

29:07.240 --> 29:09.560
I serve the Second Prince.

29:10.480 --> 29:13.879
Yuan Meng and Prince Jing
know each other,

29:14.960 --> 29:18.960
and Prince Jing frequents
His Highness' place.

29:20.240 --> 29:21.839
That's how I got to know Yuan Meng.

29:22.850 --> 29:25.550
When Yuan Meng offers her service
at the Baoyue Pleasure House,

29:26.800 --> 29:28.800
I saw an opportunity in this

29:29.599 --> 29:31.800
and secretly helped
the Baoyue Pleasure House

29:32.280 --> 29:35.520
with the indenture matters
behind His Highness' back.

29:37.240 --> 29:39.599
Unfortunately, someone found out.

29:40.480 --> 29:42.520
So I hired hitmen,

29:44.559 --> 29:46.240
which then

29:47.760 --> 29:49.599
led to the murder.

29:52.440 --> 29:53.960
I was being too greedy.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.280
It was all done by me.

30:02.119 --> 30:03.460
His confession is quite conclusive.

30:03.480 --> 30:05.059
He took all the blame for it.

30:05.079 --> 30:05.859
He said

30:05.879 --> 30:09.099
he used your name to hire hitmen

30:09.119 --> 30:10.839
in an attempt to plant the crime on you.

30:11.240 --> 30:12.819
This doesn't make any sense.

30:12.839 --> 30:14.240
If he used my name to hire the hitmen,

30:14.240 --> 30:16.119
why did he kill them?

30:16.879 --> 30:18.280
Those murderers left a trail

30:18.280 --> 30:20.220
leading to him,

30:20.240 --> 30:22.500
so he had no choice but to kill them.

30:22.520 --> 30:23.579
However,

30:23.599 --> 30:25.619
his confession
has cleared your suspicions.

30:25.639 --> 30:26.819
I was worried

30:26.839 --> 30:28.619
he might smear you

30:28.639 --> 30:30.200
for being an accomplice.

30:30.280 --> 30:32.074
The Second Prince and I
are at each other's throats,

30:32.094 --> 30:33.660
no one would believe his guard

30:33.680 --> 30:35.240
conspired with me.

30:35.359 --> 30:37.919
As of now, Fan Wujiu
can't even help himself.

30:38.200 --> 30:40.780
He can only cut any possible ties
with the Second Prince.

30:40.800 --> 30:43.159
Is that really manageable?

30:43.240 --> 30:44.500
That will be the day!

30:44.520 --> 30:46.960
People here know too much
to pull the wool over their eyes.

30:47.400 --> 30:49.399
But the Ministry of Justice
didn't question his confession.

30:49.399 --> 30:51.059
They just turn a blind eye

30:51.079 --> 30:52.839
despite knowing the truth.

30:53.359 --> 30:54.399
You said there were two news.

30:54.399 --> 30:55.820
What about the second news?

30:56.200 --> 30:58.599
You have another visitor.

30:58.599 --> 31:00.250
I'm seriously ill. I'm not available.

31:00.928 --> 31:03.639
It's Lai Mingcheng
of the Imperial Procuratorate.

31:04.670 --> 31:05.980
That fellow who impeached me last time?

31:06.000 --> 31:07.399
Yes, it's him.

31:10.720 --> 31:12.819
He came to visit me.

31:12.839 --> 31:14.420
What is he up to?

31:14.440 --> 31:15.579
Mr. Fan

31:15.599 --> 31:17.859
is severely ill.

31:17.879 --> 31:20.099
But when he knew you came,

31:20.119 --> 31:23.119
he insisted on seeing you.

31:26.319 --> 31:28.079
How big is your house?

31:30.079 --> 31:31.240
My house?

31:31.430 --> 31:32.760
The Fan's Residence.

31:33.280 --> 31:35.240
Fan's Residence, well...

31:35.680 --> 31:36.500
I'm not sure.

31:36.520 --> 31:39.980
The size of the officials' residence

31:40.000 --> 31:43.320
is restricted according to their rank.

31:43.960 --> 31:45.980
If the Fan's Residence exceeds that,

31:46.000 --> 31:48.359
I must impeach him.

31:50.599 --> 31:52.599
Maybe you can measure the place.

31:53.800 --> 31:55.439
I'm not prepared today.

31:55.559 --> 31:56.660
Do you have a ruler?

31:56.680 --> 31:58.850
One moment. I will bring you one.

31:58.870 --> 32:00.270
There is no need for that.

32:23.839 --> 32:27.399
Wouldn't it take too long
if I measured alone?

32:27.839 --> 32:29.660
I don't know.
No one has done this before.

32:29.680 --> 32:32.079
Do you need my help?

32:32.760 --> 32:34.200
Not for today.

32:34.599 --> 32:35.800
Next time.

32:41.240 --> 32:43.500
Mr. Fan, why did you get up?

32:43.520 --> 32:45.379
I asked you to rest in the bed.

32:45.399 --> 32:46.379
Mr. Fan.

32:46.399 --> 32:48.240
You are here, Mr. Lai.

32:49.480 --> 32:50.720
Mr. Lai,

32:50.960 --> 32:52.619
I'm weak,

32:52.639 --> 32:54.359
so I won't stand up.

32:56.359 --> 32:58.780
Mr. Fan, I have asked
the imperial physician.

32:58.800 --> 33:00.919
He said you are seriously injured.

33:04.680 --> 33:06.180
So I bought you some red dates.

33:06.200 --> 33:07.919
It's good for your blood circulation.

33:08.639 --> 33:10.000
Thank you so much.

33:10.079 --> 33:12.159
We censors

33:12.159 --> 33:14.280
are only paid chump change,

33:14.440 --> 33:16.119
unlike those officials.

33:16.399 --> 33:17.980
You probably have heard

33:18.000 --> 33:19.460
that within the Capital Magistrate,

33:19.480 --> 33:22.359
we censors are the poorest.

33:22.720 --> 33:24.700
I wanted to buy some supplementary
for you.

33:24.720 --> 33:26.700
But I can't afford that.

33:26.720 --> 33:29.200
Please understand.

33:29.680 --> 33:31.220
Red dates are good.

33:31.240 --> 33:32.720
I like red dates.

33:33.280 --> 33:34.720
Please sit, Mr. Lai.

33:34.800 --> 33:35.619
Wang,

33:35.639 --> 33:36.539
serve the tea.

33:36.559 --> 33:37.980
It won't take long.

33:38.000 --> 33:39.280
Please have a seat.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.720
Let me pour for you.

33:43.520 --> 33:44.960
Mr. Fan.

33:46.879 --> 33:48.420
Your father is poisoned,

33:48.440 --> 33:49.859
and you are seriously injured.

33:49.879 --> 33:52.599
Is this the Second Prince's doing?

33:55.879 --> 33:57.839
All I can say is

33:58.000 --> 33:59.180
I have no proof.

33:59.200 --> 33:59.800
It's hard to say.

33:59.800 --> 34:02.000
Have you heard

34:02.200 --> 34:03.379
about Fan Wujiu's statement?

34:03.399 --> 34:04.139
I did.

34:04.159 --> 34:05.700
He is merely a retainer,

34:05.720 --> 34:07.280
yet he had the nerves to be involved

34:07.280 --> 34:09.620
in the Baoyue Pleasure House murder case
behind His Highness' back.

34:09.640 --> 34:11.399
That just sounds nonsense.

34:11.479 --> 34:12.419
So?

34:12.439 --> 34:14.640
So I want to impeach the Second Prince.

34:17.839 --> 34:18.919
You

34:18.999 --> 34:20.459
want to impeach the prince?

34:20.479 --> 34:22.800
We are censors.

34:22.830 --> 34:25.200
We should uphold our integrity
and speak against evil.

34:27.640 --> 34:29.439
May I ask

34:29.560 --> 34:31.479
why you are telling me this?

34:31.560 --> 34:32.900
Since

34:32.920 --> 34:34.880
the corruption investigation started,

34:34.919 --> 34:36.939
all names on that list

34:36.959 --> 34:39.339
have been officials in the Capital

34:39.359 --> 34:42.140
connected to the Second Prince.

34:42.160 --> 34:44.120
If we were to dig deeper

34:44.206 --> 34:47.019
to the core,

34:47.039 --> 34:49.039
the Imperial Procuratorate alone

34:49.120 --> 34:51.160
isn't enough.

34:52.120 --> 34:53.980
So you are suggesting

34:54.000 --> 34:55.680
that you can't continue anymore?

34:57.919 --> 35:00.260
Unless the Imperial Inspectorate

35:00.280 --> 35:03.519
could provide us
with related case files.

35:04.000 --> 35:05.260
Are you seeking my help?

35:05.280 --> 35:06.559
Not you.

35:06.879 --> 35:10.240
I'm proposing a collaboration
with the Imperial Inspectorate.

35:11.200 --> 35:12.890
If so, you should go there.

35:12.910 --> 35:14.593
What are you doing here at my place?

35:21.872 --> 35:24.952
I don't know anyone
in the Imperial Inspectorate,

35:25.039 --> 35:26.140
but you.

35:26.160 --> 35:27.879
I just impeached you.

35:27.919 --> 35:30.080
We can be considered as acquaintances.

35:30.760 --> 35:33.120
What kind of acquaintance is this?

35:33.479 --> 35:36.359
The corruption investigation
is for the sake of the state.

35:36.399 --> 35:37.700
Is that a problem?

35:37.720 --> 35:39.379
If I agree to help you,

35:39.399 --> 35:40.760
will you still impeach me?

35:40.879 --> 35:42.800
Of course I will.

35:43.359 --> 35:46.859
You are demanding my help
when you will impeach me afterward?

35:46.879 --> 35:48.980
This isn't a personal grudge.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.999
You can mix business
with personal affairs.

35:51.120 --> 35:52.499
The state law is strict.

35:52.519 --> 35:54.519
How could it be a personal favor?

35:55.839 --> 35:59.060
It's like you will bite the hand

35:59.080 --> 36:01.240
that feeds you.

36:02.080 --> 36:03.680
Forget it if you don't want to help.

36:10.839 --> 36:11.919
I will.

36:13.720 --> 36:14.800
Sorry?

36:15.839 --> 36:17.280
I will collaborate with you.

36:18.319 --> 36:19.299
Wang.

36:19.319 --> 36:21.419
Bring Mr. Lai
to the Imperial Inspectorate.

36:21.439 --> 36:23.100
He can access any related documents

36:23.120 --> 36:24.499
in the First Division.

36:24.519 --> 36:25.599
All right.

36:29.519 --> 36:30.839
Mr. Fan,

36:31.640 --> 36:34.680
you are different from what I imagined.

36:37.039 --> 36:38.160
Mr. Lai,

36:39.039 --> 36:40.359
even though you have impeached me

36:40.359 --> 36:42.280
and may do so again,

36:42.573 --> 36:44.773
I have a feeling that one day

36:44.999 --> 36:46.459
we might become friends.

36:46.479 --> 36:47.640
That's impossible.

36:47.999 --> 36:51.870
Officials shouldn't have personal relationships.

36:52.160 --> 36:53.100
You are right.

36:53.120 --> 36:54.280
However,

36:54.519 --> 36:55.879
Mr. Fan,

36:55.919 --> 36:59.260
we might collaborate

36:59.280 --> 37:01.120
on the corruption investigation.

37:02.640 --> 37:03.740
For the sake of the state.

37:03.760 --> 37:05.839
There is something I would like to ask.

37:06.359 --> 37:08.859
When will you recover?

37:08.879 --> 37:09.700
Why?

37:09.720 --> 37:11.060
After you recover,

37:11.080 --> 37:13.879
I'm going to impeach you
for the Baoyue Pleasure House case.

37:16.879 --> 37:19.720
How long will you need to finish
the documents in the First Division?

37:19.919 --> 37:21.420
One day should be enough.

37:21.440 --> 37:23.839
Two days. I will attend
the court session two days after.

37:24.160 --> 37:25.819
You will recover in two days?

37:25.839 --> 37:27.060
Since I have accepted your dates,

37:27.080 --> 37:29.479
I shouldn't delay you.

37:29.519 --> 37:30.599
Well, then.

37:30.999 --> 37:32.320
See you in the court

37:32.399 --> 37:34.320
in two days.

37:37.560 --> 37:39.220
He amazed me.

37:39.240 --> 37:40.479
I will see him off.

37:46.948 --> 37:48.359
As expected of you.

37:48.439 --> 37:51.080
The Imperial Procuratorate
just impeached you,

37:51.520 --> 37:53.260
and here comes the second impeachment.

37:53.280 --> 37:55.200
You even got me involved.

37:55.999 --> 37:58.200
What an interesting experience
for an official.

37:58.439 --> 37:59.499
Indeed.

37:59.519 --> 38:01.220
Other officials seek friends,

38:01.240 --> 38:03.499
but I seek trouble.

38:03.519 --> 38:05.399
You do know that.

38:07.120 --> 38:07.859
It's my fault.

38:07.879 --> 38:09.479
Says who?

38:10.240 --> 38:11.879
Those who harm lives or break the laws

38:11.879 --> 38:13.240
are to blame.

38:13.800 --> 38:15.060
Troubles always surround

38:15.080 --> 38:16.640
honest men.

38:16.919 --> 38:18.660
I fear anything

38:18.680 --> 38:20.439
but not trouble.

38:26.720 --> 38:27.919
Are you all right?

38:29.359 --> 38:31.120
Never mind me.

38:31.800 --> 38:34.600
As long as both of you recover.

38:39.120 --> 38:41.120
Why is he even talking to you?

38:41.479 --> 38:42.559
What's wrong?

38:43.760 --> 38:45.240
Ever since Lai Mincheng became a censor,

38:45.240 --> 38:46.160
he has been like a mad dog

38:46.160 --> 38:48.200
that bites and never smiles.

38:48.320 --> 38:51.081
I have never seen him greeting anyone.

38:51.600 --> 38:54.519
I quite appreciate Mr. Lai
as an official.

38:58.600 --> 39:00.080
The sky is getting cloudy.

39:00.839 --> 39:02.760
[Hanmo Hall]
It's the sign of rain.

39:04.120 --> 39:06.479
Let's move. His Majesty is waiting.

39:14.560 --> 39:15.860
This isn't the way to the main hall.

39:15.880 --> 39:17.920
We are meeting
at the Imperial Study today.

39:18.039 --> 39:19.740
Why? Shouldn't it be in the main hall?

39:19.760 --> 39:20.979
His Majesty said

39:20.999 --> 39:23.100
the Imperial Procuratorate's target
is you.

39:23.120 --> 39:24.459
You are only a minor official.

39:24.479 --> 39:26.439
You don't deserve to use the main hall

39:26.479 --> 39:28.640
and waste the officials' time.

39:29.080 --> 39:31.080
Fine, I don't deserve that.

39:43.399 --> 39:44.640
Where should I sit?

39:45.160 --> 39:46.240
Sit?

39:46.800 --> 39:47.819
Stand at the back.

39:47.839 --> 39:49.240
Not only Mr. Fan.

39:50.110 --> 39:52.359
I can't believe
the Imperial Procuratorate is bold.

39:55.240 --> 39:56.499
Coming through. Make way.

39:56.519 --> 39:57.260
Excuse me.

39:57.280 --> 39:59.200
Everyone is flustered.

39:59.399 --> 40:00.419
Indeed.

40:00.439 --> 40:02.160
Tell me about it.

40:05.879 --> 40:07.120
Mr. Xin.

40:09.160 --> 40:09.780
Mr. Fan.

40:09.800 --> 40:11.359
Why are you hiding here?

40:11.959 --> 40:14.919
Uh... I'm looking at books.

40:15.479 --> 40:17.019
This is a good hiding place.

40:17.039 --> 40:18.760
No one could see us.

40:20.800 --> 40:21.999
I have a question.

40:22.399 --> 40:24.120
Why are there so many people here?

40:24.240 --> 40:25.479
His Majesty said

40:25.760 --> 40:27.959
this meeting isn't compulsory.

40:27.960 --> 40:29.100
Attendance is voluntary.

40:29.120 --> 40:30.240
Voluntary?

40:30.680 --> 40:32.359
But almost everyone is here.

40:33.760 --> 40:35.839
Don't take the word "voluntary"
too seriously.

40:36.240 --> 40:37.580
Look over there.

40:37.600 --> 40:39.039
They are all here.

40:39.200 --> 40:41.100
No one dares skip the meeting.

40:41.120 --> 40:42.200
Right?

40:42.439 --> 40:44.399
His Majesty has arrived.

40:53.160 --> 40:54.700
This isn't like the main hall.

40:54.720 --> 40:56.479
No need to stand on ceremony.

41:00.399 --> 41:01.720
Do sit down.

41:03.560 --> 41:04.959
Just relax.

41:10.120 --> 41:11.200
Fan Xian.

41:12.560 --> 41:13.640
Yes, Your Majesty.

41:14.720 --> 41:15.740
Lai Mingcheng.

41:15.760 --> 41:16.840
Yes, Your Majesty.

41:18.640 --> 41:19.839
Do you still

41:20.039 --> 41:21.280
want to impeach him?

41:21.999 --> 41:22.700
Yes.

41:22.720 --> 41:24.180
Not only him

41:24.200 --> 41:27.439
but also the Minister of Revenue,
Fan Jian.

41:28.680 --> 41:29.800
Your Majesty,

41:30.120 --> 41:32.260
before Mr. Lai begins,

41:32.280 --> 41:34.160
may I propose my impeachment?

41:36.240 --> 41:37.320
Go on.

41:40.190 --> 41:41.580
Please look at this, Your Majesty.

41:41.600 --> 41:42.979
They are all precious jewels.

41:42.999 --> 41:44.220
I had them appraised.

41:44.240 --> 41:45.620
They are very valuable.

41:45.640 --> 41:46.879
Where did you get this?

41:47.080 --> 41:50.580
A few days ago, Princess Lin and I
visited a senior.

41:50.600 --> 41:52.160
He gave us this as a gift.

41:54.839 --> 41:57.419
Even a casual gift
could be so valuable.

41:57.439 --> 41:59.939
There are more in his house.

41:59.959 --> 42:01.540
His residence is built on the mountain.

42:01.560 --> 42:03.859
He gathers various rare jewels
from the world

42:03.879 --> 42:05.180
and has countless courtesans.

42:05.200 --> 42:07.879
Such extravagance is unbelievable.

42:08.359 --> 42:11.519
Who is this person, then?

42:12.720 --> 42:15.999
Director of the Imperial Inspectorate,
Chen Pingping.

42:17.080 --> 42:18.839
This is outrageous!

42:24.399 --> 42:27.780
I accuse Chen Pingping
of corruption and bribery.

42:27.800 --> 42:29.740
Please investigate him thoroughly,
Your Majesty.

42:29.760 --> 42:30.840
Mr. Chen.

42:31.640 --> 42:32.839
Yes, Your Majesty.

42:33.120 --> 42:34.339
Any explanation?

42:34.359 --> 42:35.720
Mr. Fan,

42:36.839 --> 42:40.899
is it wrong
that I gave away my own things?

42:40.919 --> 42:43.120
I don't have a say in this.

42:43.200 --> 42:47.379
The thing is, the court
is investigating corruption

42:47.399 --> 42:50.100
to preserve clear governance
and strengthen law enforcement.

42:50.120 --> 42:51.879
At this point,

42:52.120 --> 42:54.320
I wouldn't dare to accept gifts.

42:55.120 --> 42:56.280
Your Majesty,

42:57.479 --> 42:59.120
may I explain myself?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.267 --> 43:22.347
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.778 --> 43:35.338
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.906 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.878
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.898 --> 44:18.188
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
